bin/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
master.key
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
# Vite builds into the Go package, because a go:embed pattern resolves
# relative to the file holding it and embed.go lives here. The build output
# stays out of git; .gitkeep is committed so `//go:embed all:dist` still
# compiles on a checkout where the UI has never been built.
internal/panel/webui/dist/*
!internal/panel/webui/dist/.gitkeep
.env

# Generated by the graphify tool: hashed AST cache and its report. Regenerated
# on demand and ~4MB, so it is kept out of history rather than committed.
graphify-out/

# Release artifacts built by scripts/release.sh; published to GitHub Releases,
# never committed.
dist/
antimage-node.exe
antimage-panel.exe
*.exe

# Machine-local Claude Code configuration. Claude.reg in the repo root carries
# an inference-gateway API key; committing it would publish a live credential.
*.reg
